  "releaseNotes": "- fix: a `[<RequireQualifiedAccess>]` union case used as a value (e.g. aardvark.dom's `AttributeValue.String \"range\"` in `input { Attribute(\"type\", AttributeValue.String \"range\") }`) is now qualified by its TYPE (`AttributeValue.String`) rather than its namespace (`Aardvark.Dom.String`). RQA rejects the namespace form, which broke static HTML `NodeBuilder` subtrees inside a `[<PureView>]`. Ordinary unions are unchanged. (Model-fn HTML content like `span { fmt m.X }` already lifted correctly; a same-module unqualified helper still needs to live in a separate module — see ISSUES.md.)",
  "title": "Adaptify.PureView.MSBuild",
